sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Citizen
  participant API as Express API
  participant DB as SQLite
  actor A as Administrator
  participant MM as MetaMask
  participant SC as EcoChainRewards (Sepolia)
  C->>API: POST /citizen/submissions (+ photo)
  API->>DB: save submission (PENDING)
  A->>API: POST /admin/submissions/:id/approve
  API->>DB: status APPROVED + Verification row
  A->>API: GET /reward-params
  A->>SC: isRewarded(id)? hasRole(admin)? (read)
  A->>MM: rewardRecycling(citizen, id, category, grams)
  MM->>SC: signed transaction
  SC-->>SC: revert if already rewarded or not authorised
  SC-->>MM: tx hash
  A->>API: POST /admin/rewards (tx hash)
  API->>DB: Reward PROCESSING (submissionId UNIQUE)
  API->>SC: getTransactionReceipt (read-only RPC)
  SC-->>API: receipt + RewardIssued event
  API->>API: verify contract, citizen, category, grams
  API->>DB: Reward CONFIRMED, submission REWARDED
  API-->>C: notification: reward received
